# The uvicorn `standard` extra pulls uvloop on non-Windows platforms only, so a lock
# compiled on Windows silently omits it and `pip install --require-hashes` then aborts on
# the Linux/aarch64 target ("uvloop must be pinned with hashes"). Pin it explicitly, with a
# marker, so every recompile — Windows or Linux — records it and the target install succeeds.
